  "description": "<p>When establishing a Quest's Keeping, the party may spend up to 6 additional Treasure to enhance the quality of your services and satisfy your exacting sartorial tastes. For every 2 additional Treasure spent in this way, you gain 1 level of <em>Swagger </em>for the Quest.</p><p>For each level of <em>Swagger</em>, choose one effect, which lasts for the duration of the Quest:</p><ul><li><p>You gain one rank in Awe.</p></li><li><p>Your base Endurance increases by your BODY score.</p></li><li><p>Your base Hope increases by 2.</p></li><li><p>Your base Defense increases by 1.</p></li></ul><p>You may choose each effect multiple times.</p><p>Additionally, at the beginning of each combat, for each level of <em>Swagger </em>you have, choose two of the below dice to add to your pool of engagement dice:</p><p style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon df-d4-4\" style=\"font-size: 36px;\"></span> <span class=\"dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon df-d6-6\" style=\"font-size: 36px;\"></span> <span class=\"dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon df-d8-8\" style=\"font-size: 36px;\"></span> <span class=\"dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon df-d10-10\" style=\"font-size: 36px;\"></span> <span class=\"dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon df-d12-12\" style=\"font-size: 36px;\"></span> <span class=\"dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon dice-icon df-d20-20\" style=\"font-size: 36px;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">Choose each die type only once. These dice are available to you for the duration of the combat.</p><p><strong>Describe your expensive tastes.</strong></p>",
